# Demo capture "coconut-mall" (tools/video/capture.sh coconut-mall): a 100cc VS race on Coconut
# Mall (12 karts, items) driven by the bot. demo-vs-start.cmds reaches the Courses screen on the
# Mushroom Cup; the Flower Cup is one to the right, Coconut Mall second in its list. When A picks
# the course the page logs `[web-warm] course 5 (shopping_course) chosen` (it prefetches the
# file), which the route waits for: a wrong pick shows in driver.log as a waitlog timeout.
script tools/browser-test/routes/demo-vs-start.cmds
key ArrowRight 150
wait 1500
click 500 430
wait 4500
key ArrowDown 150
wait 1500
shot course
click 500 430
waitlog 10 course 5 \(shopping_course\) chosen
wait 4500
script tools/browser-test/routes/demo-vs-race.cmds
